<title>USA: Jones Medical Industries Inc Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Jones Medical Industries Inc Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS, Mo. 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			$  0.21		  $  0.13</p>
<p> Net			  6,054		    3,195</p>
<p> Revs			19,766		   26,224</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  24,740		   29,138</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q3 net excludes $5.7 million pre-tax charge for expenses related to August 1996 acquisition of Daniels Pharmaceuticals Inc in a pooling of interest transaction.  </p>
<p>	  NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			 $ 0.56		   $ 0.34</p>
<p> Net			 15,623		    8,501</p>
<p> Revs			73,810		   52,893</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  27,776		   24,749</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 nine months net excludes $5.7 million pre-tax charge for expenses related to August 1996 acquisition of Daniels Pharmaceuticals Inc in a pooling of interest transaction.</p>
<p>     --    Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787</p>
